  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to WFP for School Feeding Programme in Ukraine 2026</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Verksamhetsst&#xf6;d till WFP f&#xf6;r skolmatsprogram i Ukraina 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom st&#xf6;det till WFP s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lls att barn i ukrainska skolor f&#xe5;r tillg&#xe5;ng till gratis varm och n&#xe4;ringsrik mat i skolan, samt att kapaciteten att genomf&#xf6;ra skolmatsreformen st&#xe4;rks. Energil&#xf6;sningar, k&#xf6;ksutrustning och utbildning av skolkockar ing&#xe5;r.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to WFP will ensure that children in Ukrainian schools have access to free hot and nutritious food at school, and that the capacity to implement the school food reform is strengthened. Energy solutions, kitchen equipment and training of school chefs are included.</narrative>
  </description>
